OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music for your morning,
OL,8,     Fwith discoveries and surprises
OL,9,     Frubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,10,     Ffavourites.
OL,11,G1300 Classical Live
OL,12,     FElizabeth Alker showcases live
OL,13,     Fperformances and exclusive
OL,14,     Fconcerts from home and abroad,
OL,15,     Fincluding Vaughan Williams's The
OL,16,     FLark Ascending.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Falla
OL,18,     F2/5. Kate Molleson explores
OL,19,     FSpanish composer Manuel de Falla's
OL,20,     Flife in five cities. As he turns
OL,21,     Ftwenty, Falla travels to Madrid,
OL,22,     Fwhere he meets a new mentor.
